 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 1.484,
   "text": "You walk in, and you're"
  },
  {
   "start": 1.484,
   "end": 2.76,
   "text": "sure everyone noticed."
  },
  {
   "start": 3.21,
   "end": 4.092,
   "text": "The stain."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.342,
   "end": 5.521,
   "text": "The awkward wave."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.771,
   "end": 6.849,
   "text": "The voice crack."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.449,
   "end": 8.6,
   "text": "But here's the thing:"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.75,
   "end": 10.189,
   "text": "they almost certainly didn't."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.889,
   "end": 13.126,
   "text": "In 2000, Cornell psychologists"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.126,
   "end": 14.99,
   "text": "sent students into a room"
  },
  {
   "start": 15.14,
   "end": 17.001,
   "text": "wearing a T-shirt with a cheesy"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.001,
   "end": 18.321,
   "text": "pop star's face on it."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.821,
   "end": 20.027,
   "text": "Then they asked: how"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.027,
   "end": 21.234,
   "text": "many people noticed?"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.834,
   "end": 22.913,
   "text": "The students guessed"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.913,
   "end": 23.993,
   "text": "about half the room."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.393,
   "end": 26.839,
   "text": "The real answer? About 1 in 4."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.639,
   "end": 28.48,
   "text": "It's called the"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.48,
   "end": 29.433,
   "text": "spotlight effect."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.883,
   "end": 31.306,
   "text": "You feel like you're on"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.306,
   "end": 32.976,
   "text": "stage, under a giant light."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.226,
   "end": 34.287,
   "text": "But everyone else is"
  },
  {
   "start": 34.287,
   "end": 35.72,
   "text": "starring in their own show,"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.87,
   "end": 36.645,
   "text": "worrying about"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.645,
   "end": 37.531,
   "text": "their own stain."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.231,
   "end": 40.032,
   "text": "So next time you feel watched,"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.232,
   "end": 41.849,
   "text": "remember: you're the only one"
  },
  {
   "start": 41.849,
   "end": 43.076,
   "text": "holding the spotlight."
  }
 ],
